{"id":"u03","kelas":7,"no":3,"judul":"Angka, Jam, Hari, dan Tanggal","title":"Numbers, Time, and Dates","emoji":"🕒","ringkas":"Angka, menyebut jam, hari, bulan, dan tanggal","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut dan memahami angka 0 sampai 100","menyebut urutan: [[first]], [[second]], [[third]], dan seterusnya","menanyakan dan menyebut jam: [[What time is it?]]","menyebut hari dan bulan dengan benar","menyebut tanggal dan tanggal ulang tahun","memakai [[at]], [[on]], dan [[in]] untuk waktu"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Angka dan waktu dipakai **setiap hari**: umur, nomor rumah, jam pelajaran, dan hari ulang tahun. Di **Unit 3** kamu belajar semuanya. Klik angka-angka di bawah supaya kamu terbiasa mendengarnya!"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Angka 0 sampai 20","items":[{"en":"zero","id":"0","ex":""},{"en":"one","id":"1","ex":""},{"en":"two","id":"2","ex":""},{"en":"three","id":"3","ex":""},{"en":"four","id":"4","ex":""},{"en":"five","id":"5","ex":""},{"en":"six","id":"6","ex":""},{"en":"seven","id":"7","ex":""},{"en":"eight","id":"8","ex":""},{"en":"nine","id":"9","ex":""},{"en":"ten","id":"10","ex":""},{"en":"eleven","id":"11","ex":""},{"en":"twelve","id":"12","ex":""},{"en":"thirteen","id":"13","ex":""},{"en":"fourteen","id":"14","ex":""},{"en":"fifteen","id":"15","ex":""},{"en":"sixteen","id":"16","ex":""},{"en":"seventeen","id":"17","ex":""},{"en":"eighteen","id":"18","ex":""},{"en":"nineteen","id":"19","ex":""},{"en":"twenty","id":"20","ex":""}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Puluhan dan seratus","items":[{"en":"thirty","id":"30","ex":""},{"en":"forty","id":"40","ex":"Ejaan: forty, bukan fourty!"},{"en":"fifty","id":"50","ex":""},{"en":"sixty","id":"60","ex":""},{"en":"seventy","id":"70","ex":""},{"en":"eighty","id":"80","ex":""},{"en":"ninety","id":"90","ex":""},{"en":"one hundred","id":"100","ex":""}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"Angka gabungan dan angka yang mirip","text":"Angka 21 sampai 99 ditulis dengan tanda hubung: puluhan + satuan.","table":[["Angka","Ditulis","Dibaca"],["21","twenty-one","[[twenty-one]]"],["35","thirty-five","[[thirty-five]]"],["48","forty-eight","[[forty-eight]]"],["99","ninety-nine","[[ninety-nine]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"13 atau 30? 15 atau 50?","text":"Banyak orang tertukar. Akhiran **-teen** (13–19) ditekankan di **belakang**: [[thirteen]]. Akhiran **-ty** (30, 40, …) ditekankan di **depan**: [[thirty]]. Dengarkan keduanya berulang-ulang."},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Angka urutan (Ordinal numbers)","items":[{"en":"first (1st)","id":"pertama","ex":""},{"en":"second (2nd)","id":"kedua","ex":""},{"en":"third (3rd)","id":"ketiga","ex":""},{"en":"fourth (4th)","id":"keempat","ex":""},{"en":"fifth (5th)","id":"kelima","ex":""},{"en":"sixth (6th)","id":"keenam","ex":""},{"en":"seventh (7th)","id":"ketujuh","ex":""},{"en":"eighth (8th)","id":"kedelapan","ex":""},{"en":"ninth (9th)","id":"kesembilan","ex":""},{"en":"tenth (10th)","id":"kesepuluh","ex":""},{"en":"twelfth (12th)","id":"kedua belas","ex":""},{"en":"twentieth (20th)","id":"kedua puluh","ex":""}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menulis urutan","text":"Angka + **st** (1st), **nd** (2nd), **rd** (3rd), dan **th** untuk sisanya (4th, 5th, 11th, 12th, 13th, 20th). Untuk 21 dan 22: **21st**, **22nd**. Semua angka urutan dibaca dengan kata, misalnya 5th dibaca [[fifth]]."},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Menanyakan dan menyebut jam","text":"Tanya: [[What time is it?]] (Jam berapa sekarang?)\nJawab dengan pola **It's + jam**.","table":[["Jam","Cara menyebut","Catatan"],["7:00","[[It's seven o'clock.]]","o'clock = tepat"],["7:05","[[It's five past seven.]]","past = lewat"],["7:10","[[It's ten past seven.]]",""],["7:15","[[It's a quarter past seven.]]","quarter = seperempat"],["7:30","[[It's half past seven.]]","half = setengah"],["7:45","[[It's a quarter to eight.]]","to = kurang (menuju)"],["7:50","[[It's ten to eight.]]","ke jam berikutnya!"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Ingat: past dan to","text":"Menit **1 sampai 30** → pakai **past** (lewat) dari jam itu. Menit **31 sampai 59** → pakai **to** (kurang) menuju jam berikutnya. Jadi 7:45 = *a quarter to **eight***, bukan seven."},{"t":"p","text":"Cara santai: baca angkanya langsung. 7:15 → [[It's seven fifteen.]] 9:40 → [[It's nine forty.]]"},{"t":"vocab","title":"5. Hari dalam seminggu (Days)","items":[{"en":"Monday","id":"Senin","ex":""},{"en":"Tuesday","id":"Selasa","ex":""},{"en":"Wednesday","id":"Rabu","ex":"Dibaca: wenzdei"},{"en":"Thursday","id":"Kamis","ex":""},{"en":"Friday","id":"Jumat","ex":""},{"en":"Saturday","id":"Sabtu","ex":""},{"en":"Sunday","id":"Minggu","ex":""}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"6. Bulan dalam setahun (Months)","items":[{"en":"January","id":"Januari","ex":""},{"en":"February","id":"Februari","ex":""},{"en":"March","id":"Maret","ex":""},{"en":"April","id":"April","ex":""},{"en":"May","id":"Mei","ex":""},{"en":"June","id":"Juni","ex":""},{"en":"July","id":"Juli","ex":""},{"en":"August","id":"Agustus","ex":""},{"en":"September","id":"September","ex":""},{"en":"October","id":"Oktober","ex":""},{"en":"November","id":"November","ex":""},{"en":"December","id":"Desember","ex":""}]},{"t":"warn","title":"Huruf besar","text":"Nama hari dan bulan **selalu diawali huruf kapital**: *Monday*, *August*. Bukan *monday* atau *august*."},{"t":"grammar","title":"7. Hari, tanggal, dan ulang tahun","text":"Tanyakan: [[What day is it today?]] → [[It's Monday.]]\nTanyakan: [[What's the date today?]] → [[It's October 25th.]]\nTanyakan: [[When is your birthday?]] → [[My birthday is on August 17th.]]","examples":[{"en":"[[Today is Friday, March 5th.]]","id":"Hari ini Jumat, 5 Maret."},{"en":"[[Indonesia's Independence Day is on August 17th.]]","id":"Hari Kemerdekaan Indonesia pada 17 Agustus."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"8. at, on, in untuk waktu","text":"Tiga kata kecil ini dipakai sebelum waktu. Pilih sesuai jenisnya:","table":[["Kata","Dipakai untuk","Contoh"],["**at**","jam","[[at seven o'clock]], [[at 6.30]]"],["**on**","hari dan tanggal","[[on Monday]], [[on August 17th]]"],["**in**","bulan, tahun, musim","[[in October]], [[in 2026]]"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[I get up at five thirty.]]","id":"Aku bangun pukul lima tiga puluh."},{"en":"[[We have English on Tuesday.]]","id":"Kami ada pelajaran bahasa Inggris pada hari Selasa."},{"en":"[[My birthday is in March.]]","id":"Ulang tahunku di bulan Maret."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Kapan ulang tahunmu?","lines":[{"who":"Rani","en":"Excuse me, Budi. What time is it?","id":"Permisi, Budi. Jam berapa sekarang?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"It's a quarter to eight. The bell rings at eight.","id":"Jam delapan kurang seperempat. Bel berbunyi pukul delapan."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Thanks! By the way, when is your birthday?","id":"Terima kasih! Omong-omong, kapan ulang tahunmu?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"My birthday is on August 17th. How about you?","id":"Ulang tahunku tanggal 17 Agustus. Kalau kamu?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"Mine is in October, on the twenty-fifth.","id":"Punyaku di bulan Oktober, tanggal dua puluh lima."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Angka: 13–19 berakhiran **-teen**, 20–90 berakhiran **-ty**. Ejaan **forty**!","Jam: [[o'clock]], [[past]] (menit 1–30), [[to]] (menit 31–59), [[half past]], [[a quarter]].","Hari dan bulan ditulis dengan huruf **kapital**.","Tanggal: [[It's October 25th.]] Ulang tahun: [[My birthday is on …]]","**at** + jam, **on** + hari/tanggal, **in** + bulan/tahun."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan angka dengan tulisannya:","pairs":[["13","thirteen"],["30","thirty"],["15","fifteen"],["50","fifty"],["40","forty"]],"exp":"-teen untuk 13–19; -ty untuk puluhan. Jangan menulis fourty!","k":"42bb767a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Angka berapa?","say":"thirteen","options":["13","30","3","31"],"answer":0,"exp":"thirteen = 13 (tekanan di belakang), thirty = 30 (tekanan di depan).","k":"5aabc01a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Angka berapa?","say":"fifty","options":["15","50","5","55"],"answer":1,"exp":"fifty = 50. fifteen = 15.","k":"229802a0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dua puluh satu.","q":"21 = twenty-___","answers":["one"],"hint":"o _ _","exp":"21 = twenty-one.","k":"f376a086"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menulis angka 40 yang benar adalah...","options":["fourty","forty","fortie","fourthy"],"answer":1,"exp":"Ejaan yang benar: forty (tanpa u kedua).","k":"4bf8da35"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Singkatan yang benar untuk \"third\" adalah...","options":["3th","3rd","3st","3nd"],"answer":1,"exp":"1st, 2nd, 3rd, lalu 4th dan seterusnya.","k":"e4f3cc1e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pukul 3.00 tepat. Kita bilang...","options":["It's three o'clock.","It's three past.","It's half three.","It's three to."],"answer":0,"exp":"o'clock dipakai untuk jam tepat.","k":"8d17ec7d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pukul 8.30. Kita bilang...","options":["It's half past eight.","It's half to eight.","It's eight past half.","It's thirty eight."],"answer":0,"exp":"Setengah lewat = half past.","k":"f3b9fd4b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pukul 6.45. Kita bilang...","options":["It's a quarter past six.","It's a quarter to seven.","It's a quarter to six.","It's half to seven."],"answer":1,"exp":"6:45 itu seperempat jam menuju jam tujuh: a quarter to seven.","k":"dd6d1011"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Jam berapa?","say":"It's half past seven","options":["7:30","7:15","7:45","6:30"],"answer":0,"exp":"half past seven = 7:30.","k":"6983186a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Jam berapa?","say":"It's a quarter to nine","options":["9:15","8:45","9:45","8:15"],"answer":1,"exp":"a quarter to nine = 8:45.","k":"bd90439c"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Jam berapa sekarang?\"","answer":"What time is it?","exp":"What time is it? untuk menanyakan jam.","k":"f57bf059"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menulis hari yang benar adalah...","options":["monday","Monday","MONday","monDay"],"answer":1,"exp":"Nama hari selalu diawali huruf kapital.","k":"f3b3e986"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ulang tahunku di bulan Maret.","q":"My birthday is ___ March.","answers":["in"],"hint":"at / on / in ?","exp":"Bulan memakai in.","k":"61ad856b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami ada pelajaran Matematika pada hari Senin.","q":"We have Math ___ Monday.","answers":["on"],"hint":"at / on / in ?","exp":"Hari memakai on.","k":"918106d0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku bangun pukul enam.","q":"I get up ___ six o'clock.","answers":["at"],"hint":"at / on / in ?","exp":"Jam memakai at.","k":"886decb5"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan angka dengan tulisannya:","pairs":[["12","twelve"],["14","fourteen"],["17","seventeen"],["19","nineteen"],["20","twenty"]],"exp":"Angka 13-19 berakhiran -teen.","k":"3cb369a8"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bulan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["January","Januari"],["March","Maret"],["May","Mei"],["August","Agustus"],["December","Desember"]],"exp":"Nama bulan diawali huruf kapital.","k":"b04d50ad"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jam dengan cara menyebutnya:","pairs":[["7:00","seven o'clock"],["7:30","half past seven"],["7:15","a quarter past seven"],["7:45","a quarter to eight"]],"exp":"o'clock, half past, quarter past, quarter to.","k":"7d3ba77a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dua puluh lima.","q":"25 = twenty-___","answers":["five"],"hint":"f _ _ _","exp":"25 = twenty-five.","k":"9af742d6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tiga puluh tiga.","q":"33 = thirty-___","answers":["three"],"hint":"t _ _ _ _","exp":"33 = thirty-three.","k":"ff090350"},{"type":"fill","id":"Seratus.","q":"100 = one ___","answers":["hundred"],"hint":"h _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"100 = one hundred.","k":"f074592f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara membaca 8th adalah...","options":["eighth","eight","eighty","eightieth"],"answer":0,"exp":"8th = eighth.","k":"6c3735d7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara membaca 22nd adalah...","options":["twenty-second","twenty-two","twenty-twoth","second twenty"],"answer":0,"exp":"22nd = twenty-second.","k":"c4a40876"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pukul 5.05. Kita bilang...","options":["It's five past five.","It's five to five.","It's five o'clock five.","It's half past five."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menit 5 setelah jam 5: five past five.","k":"dbf0a8be"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pukul 9.20. Kita bilang...","options":["It's twenty past nine.","It's twenty to nine.","It's twenty to ten.","It's half past nine."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menit 20 → twenty past nine.","k":"7cac3389"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pukul 11.40. Kita bilang...","options":["It's twenty to twelve.","It's twenty past eleven.","It's twenty to eleven.","It's forty twelve."],"answer":0,"exp":"11:40 = twenty to twelve.","k":"c2870fe0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"What day is it today?\" dijawab dengan...","options":["It's Wednesday.","It's August.","It's seven o'clock.","It's twenty."],"answer":0,"exp":"Hari = nama hari.","k":"ba7e300d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang benar?","options":["My birthday is on May 3rd.","My birthday is in May 3rd.","My birthday is at May 3rd.","My birthday on is May 3rd."],"answer":0,"exp":"Tanggal memakai on.","k":"9a70a5f6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang benar?","options":["The class starts at 7 a.m.","The class starts on 7 a.m.","The class starts in 7 a.m.","The class at starts 7 a.m."],"answer":0,"exp":"Jam memakai at.","k":"1d6ef8ab"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sekarang pukul setengah sembilan.\"","answer":"It's half past eight.","exp":"It's half past + jam.","k":"83e0b46d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Kapan ulang tahunmu?\"","answer":"When is your birthday?","exp":"When is your birthday?","k":"38a1a4ab"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kami libur pada hari Minggu.\"","answer":"We have a holiday on Sunday.","exp":"on + hari.","k":"1422d64b"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Angka berapa?","say":"seventeen","options":["17","70","7","71"],"answer":0,"exp":"seventeen = 17; seventy = 70.","k":"af37eafd"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Angka berapa?","say":"ninety","options":["90","19","9","99"],"answer":0,"exp":"ninety = 90; nineteen = 19.","k":"4c584a4b"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Hari apa?","say":"It's Thursday","options":["Kamis","Selasa","Sabtu","Senin"],"answer":0,"exp":"Thursday = Kamis.","k":"81f6c0f9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"The English class starts at half past seven on Monday and Wednesday.\" Kapan kelas mulai?","options":["Pukul 7.30","Pukul 7.15","Pukul 7.45","Pukul 8.30"],"answer":0,"exp":"half past seven = 7:30.","k":"c8fb6b01"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My birthday is on March 12th. My sister's birthday is in June.\" Kapan ulang tahun penulis?","options":["12 Maret","12 Juni","3 Desember","6 Maret"],"answer":0,"exp":"March 12th.","k":"2c2923bd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"School starts at seven o'clock. Break time is at ten. We go home at two.\" Kapan istirahat?","options":["Pukul 10","Pukul 7","Pukul 2","Pukul 12"],"answer":0,"exp":"Break time is at ten.","k":"647a74f3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What time is it?\" B: \"___\" Jawaban B yang tepat adalah...","options":["It's a quarter past nine.","It's Monday.","It's August.","It's twenty."],"answer":0,"exp":"What time = jam.","k":"d9b5ce7c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What's the date today?\" B: \"___\" Jawaban B yang tepat adalah...","options":["It's October 25th.","It's six o'clock.","It's Friday.","It's winter."],"answer":0,"exp":"date = tanggal.","k":"520a904c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["My birthday is at March.","My birthday is in March.","I get up at six.","We have English on Monday."],"answer":0,"exp":"Bulan memakai in.","k":"6268b5fd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["It's half to eight.","It's half past eight.","It's a quarter to eight.","It's ten past eight."],"answer":0,"exp":"half past, bukan half to.","k":"50d75079"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["Today is monday.","Today is Monday.","My birthday is in August.","It's Friday."],"answer":0,"exp":"Nama hari berhuruf kapital.","k":"69f82ea3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Aku bangun pukul lima\" adalah...","options":["I get up at five.","I get up on five.","I get up in five.","I get up at fifth."],"answer":0,"exp":"at + jam.","k":"23d4a073"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Ulang tahunku tanggal 5 Mei\" adalah...","options":["My birthday is on May 5th.","My birthday is at May 5th.","My birthday is in May 5th.","My birthday on is May fifth."],"answer":0,"exp":"on + tanggal.","k":"14aa12c9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Angka yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["twenty","thirteen","fourteen","fifteen"],"answer":0,"exp":"-teen kecuali twenty.","k":"34c617bb"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pukul sepuluh lewat lima belas.","q":"It's a ___ past ten.","answers":["quarter"],"hint":"q _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"a quarter past.","k":"5a0e5af9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pukul dua belas tepat.","q":"It's twelve ___.","answers":["o'clock","oclock"],"hint":"o' _ _ _ _ _","exp":"o'clock.","k":"7b10d303"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sabtu dan Minggu disebut akhir ___.","q":"Saturday and Sunday are the ___. (weekend)","answers":["weekend"],"hint":"w _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"weekend.","k":"f1fc4de9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bulan setelah Oktober adalah ___.","q":"The month after October is ___.","answers":["november","November"],"hint":"N _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"November.","k":"66b248bb"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sekarang pukul setengah sepuluh.\"","answer":"It's half past nine.","exp":"It's half past + jam.","k":"8324e27b"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Hari ini hari Jumat.\"","answer":"Today is Friday.","exp":"Today is + hari.","k":"8d49e0af"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ujian kami pada bulan Maret.\"","answer":"Our exam is in March.","exp":"in + bulan.","k":"532a297a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Tanggal berapa?","say":"My birthday is on June twenty second","options":["22 Juni","20 Juni","2 Juni","12 Juni"],"answer":0,"exp":"twenty second = 22.","k":"2f096ae9"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Jam berapa?","say":"It's twenty to nine","options":["8:40","9:20","8:20","9:40"],"answer":0,"exp":"twenty to nine = 8:40.","k":"c91e34be"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu ditanya, \"What time does school start?\" 